OL,3,GNEWSACar thief who made #194k can only
OL,4,Arepay #970
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thief who made almost #200,000 by
OL,7,Fstealing high-value cars from driveways
OL,8,Fin Lincolnshire can pay back just #970,
OL,9,Fa court has heard.
OL,11,FEthan Taylor, 23, was jailed for seven
OL,12,Fyears and eight months in July after he
OL,13,Fadmitted 23 offences of burglary,
OL,14,Fattempted burglary and theft.
OL,16,FTaylor, of Aylestone Lane, Wigston,
OL,17,FLeicestershire, was part of a gang that
OL,18,Fused a blowtorch to cut locks at homes
OL,19,Fbefore breaking in and taking car keys.
